WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.200
In 1974,

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.481
in Ethiopia,

3
00:00:02.481 --> 00:00:05.497
scientists found a skeleton about

4
00:00:05.497 --> 00:00:07.737
3.2 million years old.

5
00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:09.709
They named her Lucy.

6
00:00:10.037 --> 00:00:13.019
Lucy is an Australopithecus afarensis,

7
00:00:13.019 --> 00:00:14.503
