8
00:00:14.503 --> 00:00:16.060
Her pelvis and legs show

9
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.782
she walked upright.

10
00:00:18.121 --> 00:00:21.158
Australopithecines walked upright with small

11
00:00:21.158 --> 00:00:23.769
brains. Homo erectus left Africa,

12
00:00:23.769 --> 00:00:25.145
and used fire.

13
00:00:25.145 --> 00:00:26.507
Then Neanderthals,

14
00:00:26.507 --> 00:00:28.457
